[{"id":"playwright-sync-async-choice","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["同步API","异步API"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(二)快速开始.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(二) 快速开始","articlePath":"posts/da4e7889/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright文档(二)快速开始.md","articleTitle":"Playwright文档(二) 快速开始","articlePath":"posts/da4e7889/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>一个普通 pytest UI 回归套件没有既有异步运行时，优先选择哪套 API？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>A\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>同步 API 更直接；并行扩展通常由 pytest-xdist 和 CI 矩阵承担。只有既有异步上下文或明确并发需求时才选择异步 API。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["A"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>同步 API\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>同时混用两套 API\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>仅因测试数量多就改为异步 API\u003c/p>\n"}]}]